BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_08fd8daa-f93a-3fdd-99b4-c7c94d430ffc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
